WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:03.360
Unit five. Injury Prevention!

2
00:00:04.308 --> 00:00:08.129
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:11.944
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.994 --> 00:00:15.800
Today we learn about Injury Prevention. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.493 --> 00:00:20.626
Protective gear. Say it with me. Protective gear!

6
00:00:24.178 --> 00:00:27.944
Caution. Say it with me. Caution!

7
00:00:31.393 --> 00:00:34.910
Hazard. Say it with me. Hazard!

8
00:00:38.411 --> 00:00:42.228
Supervision. Say it with me. Supervision!

9
00:00:45.728 --> 00:00:49.795
Warning sign. Say it with me. Warning sign!

10
00:00:53.296 --> 00:00:56.696
Risk. Say it with me. Risk!

11
00:01:00.201 --> 00:01:03.884
Accident. Say it with me. Accident!

12
00:01:07.382 --> 00:01:10.882
Prepared. Say it with me. Prepared!

13
00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:23.374
Wearing protective gear and using caution helps me avoid a hazard. Adult supervision and a warning sign can reduce risk. Being prepared helps prevent an accident.

14
00:01:23.424 --> 00:01:24.574
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:31.202
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.252 --> 00:01:32.402
Hazard!

17
00:01:33.266 --> 00:01:38.627
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.677 --> 00:01:39.827
Accident!

19
00:01:40.783 --> 00:01:48.853
Did you know? When skating, wrist guards, knee pads, elbow pads and a helmet protect the parts of the body that get hurt most often!

20
00:01:48.903 --> 00:01:50.817
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.615 --> 00:02:00.145
Think and answer. What protective gear do you use for your favorite activity?

22
00:02:00.195 --> 00:02:01.345
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.542 --> 00:02:07.355
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:07.405 --> 00:02:10.073
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

